{{Quote|Welcome to Olega. We didn't think Coruscant would be interested in our little break-in&mdash;|[[Cord Taunus]]|<ref name="Revenge / Justice" />}}
'''Olega''' was a [[planet]]<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|olega|Olega}}</ref> located far from the [[Core Worlds|Core World]] [[Coruscant]]<ref name="Databank Temple">{{Databank|olega-jedi-temple|Olega Jedi temple}}</ref> that was home to [[Olega City]] where the [[Jedi Order]] operated a [[Olega Jedi temple|Jedi temple]] during the [[High Republic Era]]. The [[Force-sensitive]] [[assassin]] [[Mae-ho Aniseya|Mae Aniseya]] visited Olega to [[Death|kill]] [[Jedi Master]] [[Torbin]], who had taken the [[Barash Vow]] at the Olega [[Jedi temple]]. Jedi Master [[Sol]], his [[Padawan]], [[Jecki Lon]], [[Jedi Knight]] [[Yord Fandar]], and Mae's sister, [[Verosha Aniseya|Osha]], confronted her on Olega, although she managed to escape.<ref name="Revenge / Justice" />

